// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Actor1 :
"P4017280341" "<em StanceHero2>"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3795884544" "<em StanceHero2 t=5 d=5><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>Stefan Richter. The embodiment of chaos at the doorstep of law."
// 7 Actor2 :
"P2068668082" "<em laugh t=7 d=7><color Red><bgcolor Black>Chaos? Hardly. I'm here to put an end to this and to you, Cole. Not to mention taking your precious technology..."
// 6 Caption :
"P1632400302" "<x=0.5 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>I've taken plenty of precautions to ensure I won't meet the same fate as my Praetorian self. Don't you see, Cole?"
// 6 Caption :
"P2125278486" "<x=0.5 y=0.3 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>You believe you stand for law, but you merely stand for control."
// 6 Caption :
"P1597418170" "<x=0.5 y=0.3 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>And I will happily show you how Arachnos deals with those who seek to control OUR world."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P4130433094" "<t=5 d=5><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>Impressive speech, Richter. Sadly, it is not as impressive as your army."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2324486249" "<t=5 d=5><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>It is my duty to rid both worlds of your chaos. Your pathetic little armies will not stand in my way!"
